/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/KiGqJvL3OGJKitX4vO5l8rscROrR057V.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"キャッチ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/QArmVC6vuQyJ8dAdRvan4g3eQoxDmBjq.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"見つけました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/39bbD8YfNHxv8bybWoefXJLL17HFPHUI.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"エンカウント、リンクします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/HsOdN6tba3sqnD1558n35EcokaBiaSW3.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ヘルツ調整中……よく聞こえてますか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/CwncQgs95GacE943itMD18LQACAZTIyJ.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"素晴らしい判断です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/ND74z2ZivphlLCU3OY8aRV3Fv7WuRhQ6.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"適切な選択だと考えます","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/qNh9gdWkfOx1Dp3jJpaOOECM0FXSF5qA.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":" ミレニアム学園、音瀬コタマ。先生の声が聞こえたので、ここに来ました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/Ssy0olTFpt2UoNxEEagirSQcBhnoiqXM.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この調和された力は…まるで洗練されたオーケストラのようですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/Hrim2pVuFRrmkeJSWqpSu7kS7bpfQrE2.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"これで私はもっと