E7%8E%89/0eXXa5MZGT2y6iEpD9NY58hEgxviEqX7.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ビクッ…いきなり来られたので、キャア、と悲鳴をあげるところでした。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/dSEeU3MEh6nShO37hf39Xt2alT6p4Gyu.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"心拍数上昇、血流加速、体温上昇、原因は、不明…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/pavx5u5oU09F2oXpadTQserDAqsmDR4v.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"今まで先生と交わした全ての会話は録音してあります。 もしかして……聴きたいですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/he2lnJIZiu0hqPwzKdbj65E17qBXwMde.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生の声は、私にとって音楽と同じです。私の心を高揚させますから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/4zFwuTNr2ApcSUriGhSRrVhGAxPz8RHb.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"確信…しました。先生は私にとって特別です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/1s5gzvu9sZxogPDe4wk36WjzsjTEwx1j.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"誕生日…祝ってくださってありがとうございます。 今日もらった数多くのお祝いの中で、先生の声でのお祝いが、私には一番価値のある言葉でした。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/f4nVzOyiukOrTFGPNBBtzI23VF9Eqwbi.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。もう何度も同じことを聞いてると思いますが…。 お祝いの言葉は、どれだけ繰り返し言っても価値の下がらない、完璧な言葉の一つです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/sol58JztaqVbt3Zu2otJvKU8KUP4y08o.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ハロウィーンのお化けが出すラップ音はどんな音なんでしょうか。 機会があればぜひ一度盗聴…いや、録音してみたいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/d1NpmeOXbZ9FKmSZTDrzJGJNneqNPhCc.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" 新年はどんな音よりも、もっとたくさん先生の声を聞きたいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/Y5DFh3WnnNezigyc0ptSZ57hOCfT0ypw.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"クリスマスに傍受装置へ耳を澄ませていると様々な面白い話が聞けます。 例えば…恋人たちの甘いささやきとか。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/RAcsoSZtaE1cZ8ULYNzRGqLgOuhqRZ19.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"ミレニアムサイエンススクール所属、音瀬コタマ。先生の声が聞こえたので、ここに来ました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/x7nAW3RtLHigWJbhFChKDVQQ1TzOkOSY.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_0","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/ywarCfCz2NIG8apGfC1Rvn5vpFhDNfwG.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"…あっ、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/2XYUVKPC3tJMJrPcqe3fZq34ym6BFrZS.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"すみません…夢中になっていて、気がつきませんでした。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/39BOeTXzWZntb75hxmyRklE5lANNxvh8.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"これ、ですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/6n09nHjfZrWmsx5xFXS55OAdluXXRfVf.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"…ふふっ。せっかくですし、先生も聞いてみますか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/ayUUcIEe6JH6lCmKfpS2aFKjYOKFefUH.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"はい。これは音楽ではなく、カフェにいる人たちの会話や音が収録された、いわゆる「環境音」です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/vYWREDQNIntoYySRG68dqVaI2Mt5xklP.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"リズムもメロディーもありませんが… 耳を澄ませていると、様々な音や声が聞こえてきます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/O1A0Ovj8IhBnBvSazBTlu6gSDh54mNHX.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"人々が織りなすこの音色が、私にとってはなぜだか、どんな音楽よりも、心に響いて…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/zVmtx4oaZj9QWwh8FwpW8h9O85ofVM4h.ogg"},{"description":"Kotama_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"いつまでも、聴いていたくなるんです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/BMuVszGSN3428nR1Yl0826GQSLXaTpzE.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"kotama_title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/jV3DBZA2mzm5Ry3CPllVbvB55jXzInhE.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_battle_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"战斗开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/2HYQOuAC0Su5j6GdFGmvjBxTgXr7eL7q.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_battle_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"作战开始，搜索敌人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/ubbuL0r5IgOZZjBBtURtJs7pEY5n1XWs.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_cafe_act_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"确认咖啡厅的新款甜点......上传至私人博客......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/zIf6N8ZLGe69AmbE8FqKEYcEg6CJXdkh.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_cafe_act_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"MomoFriends的新款周边......大的要来了......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/RM4iR4Rl5ixluWwogS7SYa2c5b67Z15z.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"这个咖啡厅里有没有窃听器呢......唔，原来如此......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/5NQVJa4ymuTCPSODmFgl8wnFw2qmij3O.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"信号的接收状态有点不稳定。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/O6XqvX1ivmt5vUwYoGGL6eu4h1uI5xjZ.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"奇怪，老师的卫星定位明明显示就在附近......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/bpL0u7OuKSpH8stvOjNlypN8CvX2VCH8.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_commonskill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"你所有的企图我都了如指掌。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/R3C04WQjCiKwEIDeZUoJFLBUvVG8mBJo.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"监听开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/F9IRkICl7hANMYijMMDrFuMkzwxNqHUU.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嘘——要开始监听了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/eqDA8Mbc4VsYzOJ1J3RE5jUUIyoyjVp2.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"什么都骗不过我的耳朵。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/rW4M8hMM1jjwXoOh5lVSjI04LPs9ZKOk.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"抓到了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/dwbaSvSOxHL1UXtN4mCSzTHXlv0Fbka0.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"找到了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/VQxKWVWoiSLsOdW1wNAZOhMThnpsrmv4.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"已遭遇，准备连接。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/wKTvotFe7Ci8wqhaDszsnR1l8a7vZ7ou.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exweapon_get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"正在调整赫兹数。能听清楚吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/oDUkrYwikJHMe0IPnfyLzK5uIQNTGW8V.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_formation_in_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"很好的决定。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/GqWPnt24iTg69eCqMwJ40vhyN1WT7LrL.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_formation_in_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"我认为，这是正确的选择。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/AEEH7u5ZyAEVZ07M5UTymPtdseBoR95b.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"我是千禧年的音濑小玉，因为听到了老师的声音，所以就来这里了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/UaRUIj3ZPiWnk0wCuZeJ162N5zDH3MLT.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这种和谐的力量......就像一支配合完美的管弦乐队......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/aC6zfA2Fs5H5jJvH7BxNXUnQIjHKFAlu.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这样，我就变得更强了。您尽可以试试看。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/WwIWeuG8eDNfooFoAhofTt3Nfr97P6Wy.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这流畅的旋律......我还想听到更多！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/EiGJVo4WD1xbdn9YJvrir2UYpAh5dww3.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这样，就能听得更清楚了。就连老师的心跳声也听得到。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/UseG3nCN3M0vcn6698jsZpDjDSP3HjX8.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师的通话记录里全都是一些女生的名字呢。请老师解释一下。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/gMmvPnT3vB7X1I9wdzYOn8B45N1EQ3AG.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"违规......？您在说什么呢？窃听可不算是违规哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/drMSqBgtkdDEwyQfyjz9oSOmBR1IaaEj.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"刚才老师在社交网络的私密账号上发布的内容，能解释一下吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/z8a2MI0vLP3XHUE4T5lpj90YkfDg6dNZ.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您能不能唱一首歌给我听听？对着这个录音机。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/OgIhf0g6Jfer0B9d84qXEWY6mE4HuwbD.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"不知道从哪里传来了一群女孩子正在找老师的声音。......还是无视好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/vnABnujs0JYzcHTkrXrgSuKwWjChMhzR.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_login_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"您来了啊。我只听脚步声就知道是老师了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/kkUbowNQMrqzvF4oXpQBhlIZ6pC60lES.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_login_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"诶......您来得这么突然，吓得我差点“诶呀”一声叫出来。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/MX39eGAh02iN81kNSNxCrJ3eJRPRZlwC.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"心率加快，血流加速，体温升高......原因，不明......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/OTXrIMRJni17v1ttbRxA5XqJe5HW4knm.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"目前为止，我和老师之间的所有对话我都录下来了。也许，您会想听听？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/g7SjxAIJp619pAmQrE83FoUHfIZcfNzM.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"老师的声音对我来说，就像音乐一样。因为它会振奋我的心情。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/tfSFXpifqzPYnbeCpGwjFB3kZ7C149UD.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"我现在确信了，老师对我来说很特别！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/N15O09CGD3yqXcBPTHw6ZpZlefQvpDRJ.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢您祝我生日快乐。我今天收到了那么多的祝福，但老师亲口对我说的祝福，对我来说是最有价值的一句话。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/zTDMvZ0tboXDqa0ad9CC1ooZmSZbBn6x.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐，老师。虽然这句祝福您可能已经听了很多遍了，但祝福无论说多少次，意义都不会减少，是最完美的话语之一。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/yXzjLwz6bu3VpHFzLuxFd0XEaRUPIJmF.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节的妖怪发出的那种有节奏的声音，到底是什么样啊？如果有机会，我一定要窃听......不对，录个音听听。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/dQ1XvP8JbqswMuLUZzGZiJOxfdI4VV2O.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"新的一年，我最想听的不是别的声音，而是老师的声音。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/plcknGGmFTNI5YELKffD552rvGjs3j5D.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞的时候，仔细听听监听装置，可以听到很多有意思的东西。比如说......情侣间甜蜜的悄悄话。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/htNCEYib5XxOMABCWW7ZTNMsnWmriK71.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"如果把窃听器放进月饼里的话……嗯，似乎可行。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/itsJgJbZQMfOzukyIzR3oXQXVAxnSAT9.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"我听到了象征新春开始的钟声。老师，您要听听看吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/3eURxft5rFxYbo8bpK9lZvhEXWafpXZt.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_0","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_0.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……啊、老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"抱歉……我听入迷了， 没注意到您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"您说，这个吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"……呵呵，机会难得， 老师要不也听听看？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，这不是音乐， 而是咖啡馆里的说话 声和周围的其他声音。也就是所谓的“环境音”。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然没有节奏和旋律……但是认真去听的话， 就能听到很多与人相关的声音。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"这种人与人交织出的日常声音， 对我来说比什么音乐都更令我 着迷。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"感觉能一直听下去。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/cn/kotama_memoriallobby_5.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"kotama_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/kotama_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/kotama_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/kotama_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/kotama_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/kotama_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9F%B3%E6%BF%91%20%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%89/original/kotama_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"kotama_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","te